7796de7","priority":0.198,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A ticket carries two identical `base:feature-x` labels","A ticket carries `base:feature-x` and `base:feature-y`"],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Define conflict as two or more base: labels with DISTINCT branch values; deduplicate identical values before the count so a repeated identical declaration is honoured, not held.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Specify how a transient/non-zero `git ls-remote` failure (network/auth, distinct from empty-result) is handled when resolving a declared base — whether it is held like an unresolvable branch or surfaced, so it does not abort the intake pass.","cohort":["E3","E5","F4","G5","T5b","T5e","T6","T9","necessity"],"criteria":["T5b"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'remote_head returns an empty string for a branch that does not exist on the remote'","'git ls-remote exits 0 for a ref that does not match, so check=True does not catch it' — this only covers the no-match case, not a network/transient failure where ls-remote exits non-zero or hangs","'caught around the ledger call in _start, so one unroutable ticket does not abort the rest of the intake pass' names only the typed UnresolvableBaseBranch"],"finding":"The plan closes the 'branch does not exist' failure mode (empty remote_head -> UnresolvableBaseBranch), but does not address a transient/network failure of the underlying `git ls-remote` call — a case distinct from an empty result. If the remote is unreachable or `ls-remote` exits non-zero, `remote_head` (which uses `check=True`) would raise a different exception, and the plan only names `UnresolvableBaseBranch` as caught in `_start`.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f4167b1392d862297","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach / Grounded assumptions ('remote_head returns an empty string')","norm_id":"n7409a38bb1da4ec3","priority":0.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Remote is temporarily unreachable during an intake pass while resolving a declared base","git ls-remote exits non-zero (auth failure, network partition) rather than returning empty"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_ratio